- New editor window: MarioTrickster > Level Builder > Save Scene to Snippet Library
- Step 1: Bake current AsciiLevel_Root to ASCII (reuses AsciiLevelBaker reverse logic)
- Step 2: Choose save mode — Add New or Replace Existing
- Step 3: One-click save to LevelSnippetLibrary.cs (auto-persisted)
- Replace mode preserves existing tags (mainRoute/shadowRoute/trapRoles/budget/testGoal)
- Add New mode auto-generates timestamp-based name if left blank
- Duplicate name detection with optional overwrite prompt
- ASCII preview editable before save
- Zero external dependencies, compiles standalone under Unity Editor
